Philox4x64-10 (the default engine) and Threefry4x64-13. Reference: J. K. Salmon, M. A. Moraes,
R. O. Dror and D. E. Shaw (2011), "Parallel random numbers: as easy as
1, 2, 3", SC '11, <doi:10.1145/2063384.2063405>.


